{
    "namespace": "kabegame",
    "name": "gallery_all_router",
    // 6e 起 Contrib 形态: 贡献 images.crawled_at ASC 基础排序 (从 v4.0.1 GalleryAllProvider
    // 迁移; 6c → 6d 之间的 delegate 写法漏掉了这条 ORDER BY)。
    // 注意: 本 provider **没有 query 块**, 因此不贡献 limit/offset ——
    // `images://gallery/all` 是无界集合, 不等价于 `.../_kb_x100x/1`
    // (dsl_e2e.rs 的 `count("images://gallery/all") == 120` 即为此语义的锚点)。
    // 分页只由全局 `_kb_x<N>x` 提供并交给 gallery_paginate_router 写 limit/offset。
    // 也**不要**在这里补 limit: runtime.count() 是 SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (<inner>),
    // build_sql 末尾会 render_pagination, LIMIT 会被套进子查询, 使全局总数塌成 100
    // (前端画廊的总数/页数即取自这条路径)。无界读取的防护在 MCP 层做, 见 cocs/mcp/MCP_SERVER.md。
    "list": {
        "${page.name}": {
            "child_var": "page",
            "delegate": {
                "provider": "page_size_provider",
                "properties": {
                    "page_size": 100
                }
            },
            "provider": "query_page_provider",
            "properties": {
                "page_size": 100,
                "page_num": "${page.meta.page_num}"
            },
            "meta": "${page.meta}"
        }
    },
    "note": "Every image, ordered by crawled_at ascending. This node is UNBOUNDED: reading images://gallery/all directly returns the whole library, so append /_kb_x100x/1 for the first 100, or /_kb_desc/_kb_x100x/1 for newest first. Any global page size _kb_x<N>x with N >= 1 works. Listing this node still enumerates the local default-100 page numbers; global `_kb_` entries are not listed."
}
